SUMMARY:Quest for Learning - 50th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 50th anniversary of Quest Lancaster with educational seminars for intellectually curious lifelong learners on a variety of subjects ranging from history\, science\, world views\, archaeology\, and more during this 6-week program: \n\n\n\nOct. 1 Subjects:  \n\n\n\n\nThe Lost Oak of Lancaster with Len Eiserer\, PhD\n\n\n\nFrom Cherry to Cup: How to Make Coffee with Dr. James A Delle\n\n\n\nDon Quixote: The First Modern Novel with Dr. M.-Ana Borger-Greco\n\n\n\nLancaster Symphony Gems: Past and Present with Peter Brye\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
