SUMMARY:Art Inspired by Fall: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Join PC&D to explore the fall season with creating some beautiful fall inspired paintings! We will explore watercolors and tempera paints\, to create lovely fall landscapes. We will learn about fall and its characteristics\, and the science behind the color changes in leaves. This workshop is geared toward any experience level\, and it will be an afternoon of autumnal fun! Expect your child to have some lecture and guidance followed by open creativity! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
