SUMMARY:Bad Saints Jazz Fest at West Art
DESCRIPTION:West Art presents the first annual Bad Saints Jazz Fest! Come for a full weekend of perfectly mischievous live music that boldly explores the corners of the genre: big band swing\, Latin grooves\, hip-hop\, soul\, and much more\, with an incredible lineup of national and regional talent\, including Theo Croker\, Big BoyBrass\, Black Buttafly\, Chelsea Reed and many more. \n\n\n\nGet ready for an unhurried weekend wandering among three stages at West Art and The Abbey up the block\, enjoying local food trucks and tasty drinks at the West Art Bar. Come early for Jazz Brunch\, and linger after for Bad Saints After Dark\, a late-night jazz jam. Full weekend passes & day passes are on sale now! \n\n\n\n\n    Get tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/bad-saints-jazz-fest-at-west-art/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-09-at-8.55.56-AM.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="West Art":MAILTO:westartlanc@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
