SUMMARY:Revolution to Reconstruction with Clint Smith
DESCRIPTION:LancasterHistory will welcome award-winning author Clint Smith to the Ware Center for Revolution to Reconstruction: Pennsylvania and the Fight for Liberty & Equality. Smith\, author of How the Word Is Passed and Above Ground\, will explore Pennsylvania’s central role in shaping our nation’s evolving ideals of liberty and equality. The event will include a lecture followed by Q&A.  Pocket Books will also be on site selling signed copies of How the word is passed. The lecture is FREE\, but advance registration is required and space is limited. \n\n\n\n\n    register
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/revolution-to-reconstruction-with-clint-smith/
LOCATION:LancasterHistory\, 230 North President Ave\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="LancasterHistory":MAILTO:info@lancasterhistory.org
END:VEVENT
