SUMMARY:Quest Lancaster's 50th Anniversary Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 50th anniversary of Quest Lancaster with educational seminars for intellectually curious lifelong learners on a variety of subjects ranging from history\, science\, world views\, archaeology\, and more during this 6-week program: \n\n\n\nOct. 8 Subjects: \n\n\n\n\nTwo Special Maple Trees with Len Eiserer\, PhD\n\n\n\nA Glittering Speculation: Coffee and Colonialsim with Dr. James A Delle\n\n\n\nGeorge Eliot’s Daniel Deronda: A Novel of Ideas with Dr. Robert J. Bresler\n\n\n\nShrinking News\, Shrinking Views with Ernie Schreiber\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/73715/
LOCATION:Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 South Duke Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
END:VEVENT
