SUMMARY:Next Gen: Round Table
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Next Gen Round Table as we partner with Loxley’s Restaurant and Patio Bar and bring together four local leaders for an interactive\, small-group learning experience. Attendees will rotate between each leader in twenty-minute sessions. Every leader will follow a structured guide\, and guests will receive thoughtful questions to help spark meaningful conversation. This event is designed to build relationships\, share insights\, and create an approachable space to learn from leaders in our community. Sponsored by: A1 Energy and Viocity.  \n\n\n\nWe also need your help! We are partnering with Community Hive to support their Food Program\, which sends food home with those in need. If you bring one of the items below to this free event\, you will receive an extra raffle ticket as a thank you for supporting the cause. Most needed items: Canned Fruit Chunky Soup Cereal Snacks Canned Meat Thank you for helping us make an impact beyond the room! \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-gen-round-table-7/
LOCATION:Loxley’s Restaurant\, 500 Centerville Rd\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/Next-Gen-Round-Table-Oct-Meet-the-Leaders.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
