SUMMARY:Creepadama: A Haunted Kokedama Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Creepadama puts a spooky spin on the Japanese art of Kokedama — a “moss ball” planting style where living moss wraps around a ball of soil to create a unique botanical sculpture.\nCreate your own haunted moss garden complete with creepy embellishments\, webs\, and eerie details. You’ll learn the history behind Kokedama\, how to care for your creation\, and leave with a one-of-a-kind plant that’s a little bit spooky and a whole lot alive. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/creepadama-a-haunted-kokedama-workshop/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Creepadama.avif
END:VEVENT
