SUMMARY:Leading A.I. Well: How is That Possible? with Jason D. Baker\, PhD
DESCRIPTION:We all could use a better handle on Artificial Intelligence. What is it\, anyway? Is it really going to destroy us? How should we adapt? Is there a wise way forward? Come find out at the next Row House  Forum and lend your questions and thoughts!\n\nBaker is the author of “Leading AI Well: An Executive’s Guide to AI Strategy (The A.I. education your MBA didn’t include).” Most of his work has been at the intersection of engineering and education—using technology to help people and helping people use technology. He holds a Ph.D. in Communication from Regent University\, a Master of Computer & Information Technology – Data Science & Engineering from the University of Pennsylvania\, an M.A. in Educational Technology Leadership from The George Washington University\, and a BS in Mechanical Engineering from Bucknell University. \n\nRefreshments included. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/leading-a-i-well-how-is-that-possible-with-jason-d-baker-phd/
LOCATION:The Trust Performing Arts Center\, 37 North Market Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Jason-Baker-Speaking.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="The Row House%2C Inc.":MAILTO:tom@therowhouse.org
END:VEVENT
