SUMMARY:Gifts that Give Hope Lancaster Annual Gift Fair
DESCRIPTION:The community is invited to the 19th annual Gifts that Give Hope (GTGH) Lancaster Gift Fair at the Farm and Home Center\, located at 1383 Arcadia Road in Lancaster\, Pa. GTGH is a group of volunteers that work together to provide a one-day\, in-person shopping experience that encourages charitable giving. There is no cost to attend. Shoppers will have the opportunity to engage with more than 35 nonprofit organizations and more than 20 marketplace vendors. They can also enjoy food and beverages from local eateries\, peruse fair trade goods\, social enterprises\, business for good\, and environmentally friendly & ethically sourced gifts in the marketplace. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
