SUMMARY:Faith Festivities Maker's Market
DESCRIPTION:Calling All Makers\, Crafters & Creative Small Businesses! Do you make something wonderful? We want YOU at Faith’s Festivities Makers Market! Come share your talents\, showcase your creations\, and connect with shoppers looking for unique\, handmade treasures for the holiday season—including Halloween\, Thanksgiving\, and Christmas!  \n\n\n\nHalloween Crafts & Creations Thanksgiving Décor & Seasonal Handmade Goods Handmade Gifts Crafts & Creations Artwork & Décor Unique Finds & One-of-a-Kind Treasures Spots are limited — reserve your space today! Become a vendor and let your creativity shine! Visit https://faithumc.us/ click upcoming events & choose Faith’s Makers Market to register. Instructions for payment will populate after registered. Faith UMC • Faith’s Festivities Makers Market Where creativity\, community & the holiday season come together! *Handmade items only\, no direct sales or food permitted to be sold* \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/faith-festivities-makers-market/
