SUMMARY:Gifts that Give Hope 19th Annual Alternative Gift Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Gifts That Give Hope Gift Fair is a beloved Lancaster County tradition where the community gathers to support nonprofits\, discover ethical gifts\, and celebrate generosity.\n\nInstead of buying more “stuff\,” visitors can give gifts that make a real difference. Each gift purchased supports a nonprofit organization working to improve lives locally and globally.\n\nJoin us for the 19th Annual Gift Fair and experience a unique holiday shopping event built by the community\, for the community. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
